DTEND:20261115T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T001000Z
UID:2G5oQPEH6C
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. A young Romanian coup
 le working in Western Europe orchestrates an ambitious art museum heist af
 ter the woman is assaulted.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/rom
 anian-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/traffic\n\nEstimated start: 16:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
