DTEND:20261115T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T205000Z
UID:OWv7ividw0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 145 mins (2h25m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. The life of legendary
  conductor Sergiu Celibidache unfolds from a strict childhood to wartime e
 xile and musical brilliance.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ro
 manian-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/the-yellow-tie\n\nEstimated star
 t: 13:05
