DTEND:20261116T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T234000Z
UID:VKB5VGSO4y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 91 mins (1h31m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle P
 resented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. Amnesiac Laura and her
  family journey to Türkiye\, only to find themselves trapped in a realit
 y-bending game of illusions\, challenging their choices and trust\, leadin
 g to hilariously irrational situations.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in
 -theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/blindsight\n\nEstima
 ted start: 15:55
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
